sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as Cron Scheduler
    participant FreshPolling as pollingRefreshNewsFeeds
    participant PushPolling as pollingPushNewsFeeds
    participant CleanupPolling as pollingCleanupPushHistory
    participant DB as Supabase Database
    participant RSS as RSS Feed Sources
    participant Bot as Telegram Bot API
    participant Subscriber as Telegram Subscribers

    Note over Cron,FreshPolling: 每 60 秒執行一次
    Cron->>FreshPolling: Trigger (*/60 * * * * *)
    FreshPolling->>DB: SELECT * FROM tg_rss_feeds WHERE enabled=true
    DB-->>FreshPolling: Return feeds list

    loop For each RSS feed
        FreshPolling->>RSS: Fetch RSS XML
        RSS-->>FreshPolling: Return RSS XML
        FreshPolling->>FreshPolling: Parse RSS items with feedsmith
    end

    FreshPolling->>DB: UPSERT tg_rss_items (onConflict: title, ignoreDuplicates: true)
    DB-->>FreshPolling: Return upsert count

    Note over Cron,PushPolling: 每 2 分鐘執行一次
    Cron->>PushPolling: Trigger (*/2 * * * *)

    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT tg_rss_items (pub_date >= now() - 1h)<br/>JOIN tg_rss_feeds WHERE enabled=true
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return items list

    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT tg_watchers<br/>JOIN tg_observers (for tg_id)
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return subscribers with tg_id

    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT tg_push_history
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return push records

    PushPolling->>PushPolling: Build push tasks<br/>(filter by history & retry_count)

    loop For each push task
        alt Has push history
            PushPolling->>PushPolling: Check status & retry_count
            alt status=success
                PushPolling->>PushPolling: Skip (already pushed)
            else retry_count >= 3
                PushPolling->>PushPolling: Skip (retry limit exceeded)
            else retry_count < 3
                PushPolling->>PushPolling: Retry push
            end
        else No push history
            PushPolling->>PushPolling: First time push
        end

        PushPolling->>Bot: sendMessage(tg_id, formatted_message)
        Bot->>Subscriber: Push notification
        Bot-->>PushPolling: Success/Error

        alt Push success
            PushPolling->>DB: INSERT tg_push_history<br/>(status=success, retry_count=0)
            PushPolling->>PushPolling: Wait 500ms (rate limit)
        else Push failed
            PushPolling->>PushPolling: Extract error code
            alt Permanent error (400/403/404)
                PushPolling->>DB: INSERT tg_push_history<br/>(status=failed, retry_count=999)
                PushPolling->>PushPolling: Log: will not retry
            else Temporary error
                PushPolling->>DB: INSERT tg_push_history<br/>(status=failed, retry_count=1)
                PushPolling->>PushPolling: Log: will retry later
            end
        end
    end

    PushPolling->>PushPolling: Log summary stats

    Note over Cron,CleanupPolling: 每 60 秒執行一次
    Cron->>CleanupPolling: Trigger (*/60 * * * *)

    CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Calculate cutoff date<br/>(now - CLEANUP_RETENTION_DAYS)

    CleanupPolling->>DB: DELETE FROM tg_push_history<br/>WHERE pushed_at < cutoff
    DB-->>CleanupPolling: Return deleted count

    alt Cleanup success
        CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Log: ✅ Cleaned N records
    else Cleanup failed
        CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Log: ❌ Failed with error
    end

    CleanupPolling->>DB: DELETE FROM tg_rss_items<br/>WHERE pub_date < cutoff<br/>AND created_at < cutoff
    DB-->>CleanupPolling: Return deleted count

    Note over CleanupPolling,DB: 雙重條件防止誤刪<br/>新抓取的舊內容

    alt Cleanup success
        CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Log: ✅ Cleaned N items
    else Cleanup failed
        CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Log: ❌ Failed with error
    end

    CleanupPolling->>CleanupPolling: Log: 🧹 Cleanup task completed